  "invariants": [
    "Requester and verifier are different principals; no charity self-service activation",
    "A destination change, including a corrected NOC, always creates a new version; versions are never edited",
    "An authorized payment is dispatched only to the version pinned at its authorization",
    "Rails or providers that cannot meet the DestinationEvidence minimum are ineligible for automated release",
    "Every activation notifies the charity on both the previous and the new verified channels"
  ]
